    },
    {
      "topic": "3. Group communication and collaboration are as important as the technical skills of an individual team member to the success of a team.",
      "answer": "A",
      "options": [
        "A. True",
        "B. False"
      ],
      "analysis": "这道判断题说的是：对一个团队的成功来说，群体的沟通与协作(group communication and collaboration)和单个成员的技术能力同样重要。这句话是成立的。课件里把个人能力(individual competency)和群体协作(group collaboration)并列，当作团队成败的关键因素，还把信任感(sense of trust)、参与感(involvement)列为高效团队的属性。也就是说，光有几个技术高手不够，大家能不能顺畅沟通、好好配合同样要紧。选项 A(True) 认可这个说法，是对的；选项 B(False) 否认它，是错的。故选 A。"
    },
    {
      "topic": "4. Teams with diversity in the individual team member skill sets tend to be more effective than teams without this diversity.",
      "answer": "A",
      "options": [
