        "B. relative age of a software product being considered for retirement",
        "C. reliability of a software product following regression testing",
        "D. stability of a software product as it is modified during maintenance"
      ],
      "analysis": "这道题问的是：IEEE 的软件成熟度指数(software maturity index, SMI)是用来度量什么的。SMI 出自 IEEE Std.982.1，公式是 SMI = [MT - (Fa + Fc + Fd)] / MT，它根据每次发布时模块的增加、改动、删除情况来计算，反映的是产品在维护修改过程中的稳定性(stability)，SMI 越接近 1.0，说明产品越趋于稳定。看选项，A(maintainability based on availability)基于可用性的可维护性、B(relative age of a product being considered for retirement)考虑退役产品的相对年龄、C(reliability following regression testing)回归测试后的可靠性，这几个都不是 SMI 的含义。只有 D(stability of a software product as it is modified during maintenance)维护修改过程中产品的稳定性才对得上，故选 D。"
    }
  ],
